  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The reaction of sulphur in alkaline medium is given below:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mrow><mn>8</mn><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi>OH</mi><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8722;</mo></msubsup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mi>aq</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mfenced></msub></math></p><p>The values of &#39;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi></math>&#39; is______&nbsp;(Integer answer)</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "12",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0068_30d9a6765342.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 142px;\" /></p><p>For balancing in basic medium add equal number of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>OH</mi><mo>&#8854;</mo></msup></math>. That of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><msup><mi>OH</mi><mo>&#8854;</mo></msup><mo>&#10230;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>8</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><msup><mi>OH</mi><mo>&#8854;</mo></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>8</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>8</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><msup><mi>OH</mi><mo>&#8854;</mo></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>8</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p>"
